message: "If you use or adapt this resource, please cite it as below."
title: "Hidden Treasure in Your Pocket: An Interactive Guide to Critical Elements in Smartphones"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Peter
    family-names: Nockemann
    affiliation: "Queen's University Belfast, UK"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9864-9702"
abstract: >-
  An interactive educational resource about the critical and strategic
  elements inside a smartphone. Visitors select a layer of an exploded phone
  (display, camera, circuit board, speaker, battery, casing) to explore which
  elements it contains, what they do, where they come from, and whether they
  are on the EU and US critical raw materials lists. Includes a scored quiz
  and a guide for teachers.
keywords:
  - critical raw materials
  - smartphones
  - e-waste
  - recycling
  - chemistry education
  - science communication
